opup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span> and/or <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Shield Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Shield Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Force IV<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Force IV: Wearing this Rune Arm will imbue any weapon you wield, dealing 2d6 points of force damage per hit.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p>Not upgradeable \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p><i>These branches, found within the Tangled Trees, still remember Venom's fall and seek their revenge.</i>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Rune_Arm_of_Nature%27s_Wrath.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Rune_Arm_of_Nature%27s_Wrath.png/420px-Rune_Arm_of_Nature%27s_Wrath.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"729\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Rune_Arm_of_Nature%27s_Wrath.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817224923\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\n